+## 2026-11-19 AMD Anti-Lag 2 / XeSS 30-to-120 latency source work
+
+User requested AMD Anti-Lag integration and latency optimization, then clarified
+XeSS 4X at 30 FPS input / 120 FPS output. Isolated local branch
