+
+Linux GCC C++20 contracts: 24 Anti-Lag session and 325 fallback cadence checks,
+0 failures. i18n check has no missing translations/placeholder errors; existing
+unused startup-music catalog entries retained. Windows/MSVC/Qt player build,
+native AMD driver adapter compilation, Qt Quick execution and Radeon/physical
+latency validation NOT performed. No remote push, release or driver changes.
+The deliverable is a source patch, not a rebuilt portable application.
